# The build context of Dockerfile and Dockerfile.prod (docker-compose, the NAS packages). Without this, `COPY . .`
# brings in what a native `pnpm install` / `pnpm dev` left here: node_modules built for the host (macOS binaries
# over the image's Linux ones, an older openapi-ts after a dependency bump), .next caches and .env.local's secrets.
node_modules
.next
.next-*
coverage
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
shared-data
